-- title:
--   The chart-defined $C^1$ topology equals the tangent-map $C^1$ topology on $\mathrm{Diff}^1(M)$
-- statement:
--   Let $M$ be a compact Hausdorff smooth manifold of dimension $n$ without boundary, and let $\mathrm{Diff}^1(M)$ be the set of its $C^1$ diffeomorphisms. Two topologies on $\mathrm{Diff}^1(M)$ are in use:
--
--   1. the **chart $C^1$ topology** $\tau_{\mathrm{chart}}$, generated by the basic neighbourhoods $\mathcal N^1(f;\varphi,\psi,K,\varepsilon)$ that control $g$ and its first derivative in charts on compact sets (definition `ClosingLemma_DiffeoCrTopology` with $r=1$);
--   2. the **tangent-map $C^1$ topology** $\tau_{T}$, the coarsest topology making $g\mapsto Tg$ continuous, where $Tg\colon TM\to TM$ is the tangent map and $C(TM,TM)$ carries the compact-open topology (published definition `BCWCentralizer_Basic`).
--
--   The theorem states that they coincide:
--   $$\tau_{\mathrm{chart}}=\tau_{T}.$$
--
--   With this identification, Pugh's $C^1$ closing lemma, as published on the platform for $\tau_T$, is exactly the case $r=1$ of the mission's goal.
--
--   **Formalization Note** Both topologies live on the same Lean type `M ≃ₘ^1⟮𝓡 n, 𝓡 n⟯ M`; the statement is an equality of `TopologicalSpace` structures.
-- source:
--   Hirsch, Differential Topology, GTM 33, Ch. 2, Sec. 1 (weak C^r topology); compatibility with the C^1 topology of the published definition BCWCentralizer_Basic, needed to read Pugh's C^1 closing lemma as the case r = 1 of Open Problem Garden, "Closing Lemma for Diffeomorphism (Dynamical Systems)", posted by Jailton Viana, April 24th, 2013, https://www.openproblemgarden.org/op/closing_lemma_for_diffeomorphism_dynamical_systems (the boxed Conjecture; bibliography: Bonatti–Díaz–Viana, Dynamics beyond uniform hyperbolicity, Encyclopaedia of Mathematical Sciences vol. 102, Springer 2005)

import Mathlib
import Definitions.Def_BCWCentralizer_Basic
import Definitions.Def_ClosingLemma_DiffeoCrTopology

open scoped Manifold ContDiff Topology

namespace ClosingLemma

theorem crTopology_one_eq_c1Topology {n : ℕ} {M : Type*} [TopologicalSpace M] [T2Space M]
    [CompactSpace M] [ChartedSpace (EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)) M] [IsManifold (𝓡 n) ∞ M] :
    (crTopology 1 : TopologicalSpace (Diff n M 1)) =
      (BCWCentralizer.c1Topology : TopologicalSpace (BCWCentralizer.Diff1 n M)) := by sorry

end ClosingLemma
